<hr>

<h2>🌟 1. System Overview (सिस्टम का परिचय)</h2>
<p>
  <b>Robotics Wala Hub</b> ek complete cyber-robotics laboratory management platform hai. Ye do mukhya roles ke sath kaam karta hai:
</p>
<ul>
  <li><b>🎓 Student Role:</b> Engineering Students, Robotics Club Members, aur Lab Researchers ke liye.</li>
  <li><b>🛡️ Admin Role:</b> Lab Incharge, Professors, Mentors, aur Lab Administrators ke liye.</li>
</ul>

<hr>

<h2>🎓 2. STUDENT USER GUIDE (विद्यार्थियों के लिए स्टेप-बाय-स्टेप गाइड)</h2>

<h3>🔹 Step 1: Account Registration (खाता बनाना)</h3>
<ol>
  <li>App open karke <b>"Register as Student"</b> par tap karein.</li>
  <li>Apna <b>Full Name</b>, <b>Email Address</b>, <b>Password</b>, <b>College Name</b>, <b>Branch</b>, aur <b>Academic Year</b> bharein.</li>
  <li>Register button dabate hi account <i>"Pending Approval"</i> screen par chala jayega. Admin ke approve karte hi full access mil jayega.</li>
</ol>

<h3>🔹 Step 2: Profile & Photo Setup (प्रोफाइल और फोटो अपलोड)</h3>
<ol>
  <li>Bottom bar me <b>"Profile"</b> tab par jayein.</li>
  <li><b>Photo Upload:</b> Avatar ke upar bane <b>📷 Camera Icon</b> par tap karein aur Gallery se photo select karein. Photo turant save hokar dikhne lagegi.</li>
  <li><b>Student ID:</b> Har student ko system dwara ek unique ID (jaise <code>RWH-8F2A19</code>) milti hai.</li>
  <li><b>Edit Profile:</b> <b>"Edit"</b> button dabakar Name, College, Roll Number aur Year kabhi bhi update karein.</li>
</ol>

<h3>🔹 Step 3: QR Code Lab Attendance (डिजिटल अटेंडेंस)</h3>
<ol>
  <li>Home screen par <b>"Scan Attendance QR"</b> button tap karein.</li>
  <li>Lab me Admin/Faculty screen par chal rahe dynamic QR Code ko camera se scan karein.</li>
  <li><b>Clock-In:</b> Entry ke waqt scan karein.</li>
  <li><b>Clock-Out:</b> Lab chhodte waqt scan karein — system automatically aapke lab hours calculate karega.</li>
  <li>Apni poori attendance history <b>"Attendance History"</b> card me dekhein.</li>
</ol>

<h3>🔹 Step 4: Workstation & Lab Slot Booking (लैब स्लॉट बुक करना)</h3>
<ol>
  <li>Home screen se <b>"Book Lab Slot"</b> open karein.</li>
  <li>Date, Time Slot (e.g. 02:00 PM - 05:00 PM), aur Bench/Bay No. (Robotics Bay, Soldering Station, 3D Print Fab Lab) select karein.</li>
  <li>Purpose likhkar request submit karein. Admin approve karte hi slot confirm ho jayega.</li>
</ol>

<h3>🔹 Step 5: Robotics Projects Tracking (प्रोजेक्ट्स बनाना और ट्रैक करना)</h3>
<ol>
  <li><b>"Projects"</b> tab me jakar <b>"+ Create Project"</b> par click karein.</li>
  <li>Project Title, Description, Tech Stack (ROS2, Arduino, Jetson, OpenCV), aur Team Members add karein.</li>
  <li>Progress Percentage bar ko regularly update karein taaki mentor aapka project evaluate kar sakein.</li>
</ol>

<h3>🔹 Step 6: Hardware Catalog, Budget, Notices & Leaderboard</h3>
<ul>
  <li><b>📦 Hardware Catalog:</b> Lab me available Sensors, Motors, aur Microcontrollers ka stock dekhein.</li>
  <li><b>💰 Project Budget:</b> Hardware khareedne ke bills aur expense receipts log karein approval ke liye.</li>
  <li><b>🏆 Leaderboard:</b> Top students ki ranking dekhein aur apne certificates verify karwayein.</li>
  <li><b>📢 Notices & 📅 Events:</b> Lab notices aur aane wali workshops ki details check karein.</li>
</ul>

<hr>

<h2>🛡️ 3. ADMIN COMMAND CENTER GUIDE (एडमिन के लिए गाइड)</h2>

<h3>🔸 Step 1: Admin Login & Live Dashboard</h3>
<p>
  Admin credentials se login karte hi screen par total active students, chal rahe robotics projects, total lab hours, aur pending requests ki live analytics metrics dikhti hain.
</p>

<h3>🔸 Step 2: Student Verification & Approvals (छात्रों को अनुमति देना)</h3>
<ol>
  <li>Bottom bar me <b>"Directory / Students"</b> tab par jayein.</li>
  <li>Sabhi naye registered students <b>"Pending"</b> status me unki photo aur roll number ke sath dikhenge.</li>
  <li><b>"✅ Approve Lab Access"</b> button dabate hi student ka account instantly active ho jayega.</li>
  <li>Student ki attendance percentage, branch, aur profile details check kar sakte hain.</li>
</ol>

<h3>🔸 Step 3: Dynamic QR Code Generator (अटेंडेंस क्यूआर कोड)</h3>
<ol>
  <li>Admin panel me <b>"Generate QR Code"</b> button dabayein.</li>
  <li>Screen par dynamic attendance QR code display hoga.</li>
  <li>Ise lab screen/projector par open rakhein taaki sabhi students scan karke attendance laga sakein.</li>
</ol>

<h3>🔸 Step 4: Workstation Approvals & Inventory Management</h3>
<ul>
  <li><b>Lab Bookings:</b> Students ki workstation requests ko approve ya reschedule karein.</li>
  <li><b>Hardware Inventory:</b> Naye components (Servo Motors, Jetson Nano, 3D Filaments) stock me add karein aur available quantity manage karein.</li>
  <li><b>Budget Approvals:</b> Students dwara submit kiye gaye hardware bills verify aur pass karein.</li>
  <li><b>Broadcast Notices:</b> Lab alerts aur announcements sabhi students ke app par broadcast karein.</li>
</ul>

